  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TOMAK - Farming for Prosperity (Timor-Leste)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To&#x2019;os ba Moris Di&#x2019;ak (Farming for Prosperity, TOMAK) is a ten-year (2016 &#x2013; 2026) nutrition-sensitive agricultural development investment. The program is implemented in Baucau, Bobonaro and Viqueque and supports rural Timorese households to improve food security, nutrition, and productive, profitable, and resilient agriculture-based livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
